%description:
Tests ecnMarkAll=true with AccECN and Reno: as Linux, each segment after the
handshake is ECT(0), also the ACK of the SYN-ACK, the retransmission A004 and
the FINs. The SYN and the SYN-ACK stay Not-ECT (RFC 3168 section 6.1.1).

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 1000"
*.*_tcp.tcpEcnMode = "accecn"
*.*_tcp.accEcnOptionEnabled = false
*.*_tcp.ecnMarkAll = true
*.tcptester.script="a3 delete"
*.cli_app.tClose=6s
*.srv_app.tClose=7s

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.001 A001] A.1000 > B.2000: S E W N 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[0.003 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S W 500:500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[0.005 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: A W ack 501 win 16384 ECT(0) 
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A E N 1:1001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 ECT(0) # deleting
[4.001 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A E N 1:1001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 ECT(0) 
[4.203 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A E N ack 1001 win 16384 ECT(0) 
cli_tcp: ESTABLISHED --> FIN_WAIT_1  (on CLOSE)
[6.001 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A F E N ack 501 win 16384 ECT(0) 
srv_tcp: ESTABLISHED --> CLOSE_WAIT  (on RCV_FIN)
[6.003 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A E N ack 1002 win 16384 ECT(0) 
cli_tcp: FIN_WAIT_1 --> FIN_WAIT_2  (on RCV_ACK)
srv_tcp: CLOSE_WAIT --> LAST_ACK  (on CLOSE)
[7.001 B004] A.1000 < B.2000: A F E N ack 1002 win 16384 ECT(0) 
cli_tcp: FIN_WAIT_2 --> TIME_WAIT  (on RCV_FIN)
[7.003 A006] A.1000 > B.2000: A E N ack 502 win 16384 ECT(0) 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
